      "value": "The new social ui menu have things that makes good and poor thoughts.\n\n* First, the banners look like what people would set for a preview view. They make group banners need to change to fit again.\n\n* Second, the change from yellow names to white makes finding friends in big lobbys more difficult. However the yellow border with the addition of showing badges is a good thing, just change the name color to match the border.\n\nA thought that I think could be good.\n\n* If it's not to convoluted or difficult, the color change for friends names could have a menu option like what vrc+ gives.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-24T00:13:39.909Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Bring back the old big yellow blob for friends that are far away, the current circle with the faint yellow outline is near impossible to distinguish. We used to have it where if you press your small menu button or was just far enough away you saw a giant filled in yellow blob with a player icon to show where they are.\n\nMake the names in the user list also be yellow like they used to be as them currently being white is confusing despite the friend icon which can be missed.",
